<title>USA: Envirodyne stake cut by Cargill.</title>
<headline>Envirodyne stake cut by Cargill.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargill Financial Services Corp said Thursday it cut its stake in Envirodyne Industries Inc to 762,240 common shares, or 5.2642 percent, from 8.48 percent held in June.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cargill said its latest transactions include the sale of 465,800 common sold between November 29 and January 21 at prices ranging from $4.40 and $6.6569 per share.</p>
<p>Envirodyne, based in Oakbrook, Ill., operates food packaging and foodservice supply subsidiaries.</p>
